sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CI as ChatInput
    participant CV as ChatView
    participant APP as App.tsx
    participant API as Remote API
    participant T as Teammate Agent
    participant L as Lead Session

    Note over APP: terminals[] state (all active agents)
    APP->>APP: Filter terminals by cwd, exclude activeId
    APP->>CV: projectTerminals prop
    CV->>CI: projectTerminals prop

    U->>CI: Types @ in chat
    CI->>CI: filteredTeammates (useMemo)
    CI->>U: Show Team section with AgentAvatar

    U->>CI: Selects teammate (e.g. Swift)
    CI->>CI: Insert "@team delegate to Swift: "
    CI->>U: Show orange mention chip

    U->>CI: Writes task + sends
    CI->>APP: sendMessageForAgent(content)

    APP->>APP: Detect @team in content
    APP->>APP: Enrich with [TEAM DELEGATION MODE]
    APP->>APP: Inject leadSessionId + quack-remote instructions

    Note over L: Lead agent reads enriched prompt

    L->>API: GET /api/agents
    API-->>L: Agent list
    L->>API: POST /api/execute (agentId, prompt, leadSessionId)
    API->>T: Create session with [Team] prefix

    Note over T: Teammate works on task...

    T->>T: Stream ends + leadSessionId present
    T->>T: Auto-set status: done
    T->>API: POST /api/sessions/:leadSessionId/send
    API->>L: Inject completion notification
    L-->>U: "[Team Complete] Swift ha completato..."
